SUMMARY:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon | Ep. 1 - Into the
 Forbidden Forest With My Emotional Support Demon
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new adventure begins! We're heading into the
 mysterious Avalon Forest with young Cereza and her demon companion
 Cheshire for an evening of magic, puzzles, exploration, and beautifully
 strange adventures. A magical storybook adventure following a young
 Cereza, long before she became the legendary Bayonetta. Alongside her
 demon companion Cheshire, she explores an enchanted forest filled with
 puzzles, secrets, and dangerous creatures in a beautifully illustrated
 fantasy world.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7kzSlKMqLE8
CATEGORIES:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
