SUMMARY:Sniper Elite III | Ep. 12 - Save Churchill Part 3: Confrontation
 DLC
DESCRIPTION:The Save Churchill trilogy reaches its conclusion! After
 fighting our way through the previous missions, it's time for the final
 confrontation. Stealth, patience, and precision are going to be essential.
 Sniper Elite 3 is a tactical third-person shooter that combines stealth,
 gameplay choice and genre-defining ballistics with huge, open levels and
 the exotic terrain of World War 2 North Africa.
