SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 18 - Saint Denis Ain't No Place for
 Men Like Us
DESCRIPTION:Back into the crowded streets of Saint Denis, where
 civilisation, money, and the law are closing in around the gang. Something
 tells me blending in isn't going to be our strongest skill. Arthur Morgan
 and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and
 bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight
 their way across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
