SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 58 - Beautiful Island, Shame About Everything
 Trying to Kill Me
DESCRIPTION:Far Harbor really is beautiful. Lovely coastline. Atmospheric
 fog. Gorgeous scenery. Unfortunately, nearly everything living there
 appears determined to murder us. As the sole survivor of Vault 111, you
 enter a world destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a fight for
 survival, and every choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and determine
 the fate of the Wasteland. Welcome home.
